@* =================================================================================================
   FILE: Maroos.Web/Components/Account/Pages/ForgotPasswordConfirmation.razor URL: /Account/ForgotPasswordConfirmation
   ORIGIN: generated by the Blazor Identity template; Maroos uses it unchanged.
   PURPOSE: After "Forgot password": tells the user to check their email. It says the same whether or not
   the address has an account, so the form can't be used to find out who is registered.
   ================================================================================================= *@
@page "/Account/ForgotPasswordConfirmation"

<PageTitle>Forgot password confirmation</PageTitle>

<h1>Forgot password confirmation</h1>
<p role="alert">
    Please check your email to reset your password.
</p>
